                                "sense_id": "fac00882-8379-3a27-b2dd-cce9e1f16cc5",
                                "text": "1982, Lou Sullivan, personal diary, quoted in 2019, Ellis Martin, Zach Ozma (editors), We Both Laughed In Pleasure\nI need to lift weights & muscularize my chest—it's still so sunken in."
